{"duration": 64.166, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A Royal Navy sailor painted a gun turret black to cut blinding glare.", "start": 0.08, "end": 4.053}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Britain and France declare war on Russia in March 1854.", "start": 4.473, "end": 8.215}, {"beat": 1, "text": "The Royal Navy sends ships into the Black Sea.", "start": 8.435, "end": 10.679}, {"beat": 1, "text": "The sailor's gun crew faces Sevastopol's formidable batteries.", "start": 10.899, "end": 14.535}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The Crimean campaign opens in September 1854.", "start": 14.955, "end": 18.419}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Ships sail in seven columns, each steamer towing two sailing ships.", "start": 18.639, "end": 22.441}, {"beat": 2, "text": "British and French officers sail close in a paddle-wheel ship to check those batteries.", "start": 22.661, "end": 27.166}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The sailor's fleet now uses steam ships, metal hulls, and explosive guns.", "start": 27.386, "end": 31.467}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it is like headlights sweeping your face at night.", "start": 31.887, "end": 34.387}, {"beat": 3, "text": "That glare blinds you before you can see anything.", "start": 34.607, "end": 36.825}, {"beat": 3, "text": "The Royal Navy wanted that glare gone from the sailor's turret.", "start": 37.045, "end": 40.202}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The real reason: black paint absorbs light instead of reflecting it.", "start": 40.622, "end": 44.328}, {"beat": 4, "text": "A pale turret would bounce light straight back at the gun crew.", "start": 44.548, "end": 47.386}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Black turrets cut the glare around the gun crew.", "start": 47.606, "end": 49.749}, {"beat": 5, "text": "The irony came in 1856.", "start": 50.169, "end": 52.117}, {"beat": 5, "text": "The Treaty of Paris forbade Russia from basing warships in the Black Sea.", "start": 52.337, "end": 56.058}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Russia could no longer block other warships from passing through.", "start": 56.278, "end": 59.138}, {"beat": 5, "text": "A sailor changed a turret. The treaty rewrote the rules of that sea.", "start": 59.358, "end": 63.047}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.145, "end": 0.195, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Royal", "start": 0.27, "end": 0.57, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Navy", "start": 0.62, "end": 0.895, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "sailor", "start": 0.97, "end": 1.47, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "painted", "start": 1.545, "end": 1.82, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.845, "end": 1.895, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "gun", "start": 1.97, "end": 2.17, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "turret", "start": 2.22, "end": 2.495, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "black", "start": 2.545, "end": 2.945, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "to", "start": 3.02, "end": 3.07, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "cut", "start": 3.12, "end": 3.295, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "blinding", "start": 3.345, "end": 3.695, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "glare.", "start": 3.745, "end": 4.091, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Britain", "start": 4.517, "end": 4.792, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "and", "start": 4.842, "end": 4.917, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "France", "start": 4.992, "end": 5.467, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "declare", "start": 5.517, "end": 5.842, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "war", "start": 5.917, "end": 6.117, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "on", "start": 6.142, "end": 6.267, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "Russia", "start": 6.317, "end": 6.792, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "in", "start": 6.867, "end": 6.942, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "March", "start": 6.992, "end": 7.267, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "1854.", "start": 7.317, "end": 8.292, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "The", "start": 8.501, "end": 8.551, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "Royal", "start": 8.601, "end": 8.876, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "Navy", "start": 8.901, "end": 9.251, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "sends", "start": 9.326, "end": 9.526, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "ships", "st